<!doctype html>
<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#07111f"><title>Databases — Hosting PlanetBintang</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#07111f;--panel:#0e1c2e;--line:#2a405a;--text:#edf5ff;--muted:#9cb0c9;--accent:#79b5ff;--mint:#69e0c4}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(800px 400px at 90% -10%,#1b3c62,transparent 60%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:14px/1.55 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button,input,textarea{font:inherit}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:16px clamp(14px,4vw,40px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#07111fee}.brand{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:30px clamp(14px,4vw,40px)}.crumb{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.eyebrow{color:var(--mint);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em}h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,48px);margin:8px 0}.muted,small{color:var(--muted)}.panel{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#12243a,#0b1728);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin:20px 0}.features{display:grid;gap:10px}.feature{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:#0b192a}.feature>span{color:var(--accent);font-weight:800}.feature div{flex:1}.feature b,.feature small{display:block}.feature button,button{border:1px solid #426184;background:#17304b;color:var(--text);padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}.feature button:hover,button:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.notice{border-left:3px solid var(--mint);padding:10px 13px;background:#10283a;color:var(--muted);border-radius:5px}.log{white-space:pre-wrap;min-height:56px;color:var(--mint);font:12px/1.6 ui-monospace,monospace}.back{color:var(--accent)}@media(max-width:540px){.feature{align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}.feature button{margin-left:38px}}
</style></head><body><header class="top"><a class="brand" href="../index.reic">PLANETBINTANG / HOSTING</a><a class="back" href="../index.reic">← SEMUA MODUL</a></header><main class="wrap"><p class="crumb">HOSTING / DATABASES</p><p class="eyebrow">REIC MODULE · DATABASES</p><h1>Databases</h1><p class="muted">Workspace databases dengan enam area fungsi yang disiapkan untuk integrasi backend.</p><section class="panel"><h2>Subfitur</h2><div class="features"><article class="feature"><span>01</span><div><b>Buat database</b><small>Databases · konfigurasi dan pemantauan</small></div><button type="button" data-action="Buat database">BUKA</button></article><article class="feature"><span>02</span><div><b>Database users</b><small>Databases · konfigurasi dan pemantauan</small></div><button type="button" data-action="Database users">BUKA</button></article><article class="feature"><span>03</span><div><b>Hak akses database</b><small>Databases · konfigurasi dan pemantauan</small></div><button type="button" data-action="Hak akses database">BUKA</button></article><article class="feature"><span>04</span><div><b>Backup database</b><small>Databases · konfigurasi dan pemantauan</small></div><button type="button" data-action="Backup database">BUKA</button></article><article class="feature"><span>05</span><div><b>Query console</b><small>Databases · konfigurasi dan pemantauan</small></div><button type="button" data-action="Query console">BUKA</button></article><article class="feature"><span>06</span><div><b>Monitoring koneksi</b><small>Databases · konfigurasi dan pemantauan</small></div><button type="button" data-action="Monitoring koneksi">BUKA</button></article></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>Panel tindakan</h2><p class="notice">Mode pratinjau lokal. Tindakan di bawah ini hanya membuat catatan aktivitas di browser; belum menjalankan perubahan pada server hosting.</p><div class="actions"><button id="refresh" type="button">SEGARKAN STATUS</button><button id="export" type="button">EKSPOR CATATAN</button></div><p id="log" class="log" aria-live="polite">READY · Menunggu tindakan pengguna.</p></section><p class="muted">Koneksi produksi membutuhkan endpoint backend terautentikasi dan validasi izin per akun.</p></main><script>
(()=>{const key="pb-hosting-databases-activity";const log=document.getElementById("log");const read=()=>{try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)||"[]")}catch{return[]}};const write=(entry)=>{const rows=read();rows.unshift({...entry,at:new Date().toISOString()});localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(rows.slice(0,100)));log.textContent="TERSIMPAN LOKAL · "+entry.action};document.querySelectorAll("[data-action]").forEach(btn=>btn.addEventListener("click",()=>write({module:"databases",action:btn.dataset.action,mode:"preview"})));document.getElementById("refresh").addEventListener("click",()=>{log.textContent="STATUS UI DIPERBARUI · "+read().length+" catatan lokal";});document.getElementById("export").addEventListener("click",()=>{const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify(read(),null,2)],{type:"application/json"});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=document.createElement("a");a.href=url;a.download="databases-activity.json";a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url);log.textContent="EKSPOR CATATAN SELESAI";});})();
</script></body></html>